  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toi, là ! Je décèle en toi la solution à\nmon désarroi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0069002C0020006C00E0002000210020004A00650020006400E9006300E8006C006500200065006E00200074006F00690020006C006100200073006F006C007500740069006F006E002000E0000A006D006F006E0020006400E90073006100720072006F006900200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comme tu peux le voir, je suis peintre.\nQue dis-je, artiste peintre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065002000740075002000700065007500780020006C006500200076006F00690072002C0020006A0065002000730075006900730020007000650069006E007400720065002E000A0051007500650020006400690073002D006A0065002C002000610072007400690073007400650020007000650069006E00740072006500200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je laissais ma muse guider mon pinceau en\nimmortalisant ce paysage pour un concours...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand soudain... le drame ! La tragédie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750061006E006400200073006F0075006400610069006E002E002E002E0020006C00650020006400720061006D0065002000210020004C00610020007400720061006700E900640069006500200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’immondes ronces apparurent sans crier gare\ndevant la fontaine ! Quelle indignité !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Or, mon Pokémon ne connaît aucune capacité\napte à retirer cette insulte à l’esthétisme.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est alors que ma muse me susurra à l’oreille :\n« Face au drame, ravive la flamme ! »<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu arrives donc à point nommé !\nDélivre-moi de mes affres !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBrûle ces ronces indésirables avec une capacité\nde type Feu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brûle ces ronces indésirables avec une capacité\nde type Feu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200FB006C0065002000630065007300200072006F006E00630065007300200069006E006400E900730069007200610062006C006500730020006100760065006300200075006E00650020006300610070006100630069007400E9000A0064006500200074007900700065002000460065007500200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon âme est emplie de gratitude pour\nta courtoisie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E002000E2006D0065002000650073007400200065006D0070006C00690065002000640065002000670072006100740069007400750064006500200070006F00750072000A0074006100200063006F007500720074006F006900730069006500200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’art reprend enfin ses droits.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C2019006100720074002000720065007000720065006E006400200065006E00660069006E0020007300650073002000640072006F006900740073002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... C’est une plaisanterie ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200043201900650073007400200075006E006500200070006C0061006900730061006E007400650072006900650020003F001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces végétaux tentaculaires se multiplient !\nLes muses m’auraient-elles abandonnée ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’il y a davantage de ronces, j’ai davantage de\ntourments, et tu as davantage de travail devant toi.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brûle ces ronces qui dénaturent la fontaine\navec une capacité de type Feu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon âme déborde de gratitude pour ta\nchevalerie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E002000E2006D00650020006400E90062006F007200640065002000640065002000670072006100740069007400750064006500200070006F00750072002000740061000A00630068006500760061006C006500720069006500200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’art est enfin victorieux.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C2019006100720074002000650073007400200065006E00660069006E00200076006900630074006F00720069006500750078002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... C’est une mauvaise farce ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200043201900650073007400200075006E00650020006D00610075007600610069007300650020006600610072006300650020003F0021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces viles broussailles se multiplient ! Quelle force\nmaléfique s’immisce entre l’artiste et le succès ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si les ronces prolifèrent, mes tracas prolifèrent,\net tu connais la suite.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brûle toutes ces épineuses abominations devant\nla fontaine avec une capacité de type Feu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon âme est à court de synonymes pour te\nremercier !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E002000E2006D00650020006500730074002000E000200063006F007500720074002000640065002000730079006E006F006E0079006D0065007300200070006F00750072002000740065000A00720065006D00650072006300690065007200200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’ÂÂÂrt peut enfin prendre son envol !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900C200C200C2007200740020007000650075007400200065006E00660069006E0020007000720065006E00640072006500200073006F006E00200065006E0076006F006C00200021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je peine à comprendre... D’où pouvaient donc\nbien venir ces ronces subitement sorties du sol ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Pokémon ! C’est un Brocélôme ? Gredin,\nc’est donc toi qui as déclaré la guerre à ma muse !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brooo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420072006F006F006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourquoi me torturer ainsi, si près de l’heure\nfatidique du concours ? N’ai-je pas assez souffert ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant ! Ma muse ! Elle me parle à nouveau...\n« La fontaine, le Brocélôme, le prix du jury ! »<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dépeindre le Brocélôme au-dessus de la fontaine\nreprésenterait l’Illumis actuelle à la perfection !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBrocélôme ! Tu es maintenant le modèle d’une\nartiste.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 161
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bro ?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420072006F0020003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce chef-d’œuvre trouvera sa place aux côtés des\nplus prestigieuses peintures du Musée d’Illumis !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBrocélôme ! Tu as l’interdiction de bouger jusqu’à\nce que j’aie fini de peindre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Célôôô...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300E9006C00F400F400F4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci ! Je penserai à toi, quand les critiques\ns’évanouiront devant mon génie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu as mis le feu aux ronces, Brocélôme\na quant à lui mis le feu à mon inspiration.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brobro...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
